{"lines":[{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"x":0.070103090114626287,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.042151162829332178,"w":0.12577320098876954},{"w":0.032989689509073883,"t":"SUE:","x":0.068041237608666857,"y":0.090116279179480396,"c":1,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"y":0.086289417760303855,"h":0.016156285633707634,"x":0.13168420459147948,"t":"And who's taking part?","w":0.18608692169189453,"c":1},{"x":0.065979388687865709,"y":0.10305343512506726,"h":0.016147974163241319,"w":0.76701029459635417,"c":1,"t":"MARTIN: Well, local boat clubs, but the standard is very high. One of them came first in the West"},{"c":1,"h":0.014680829946951413,"t":"of England regional championship in May this year - it was the first time a team from","x":0.13195875517769423,"y":0.11773255812555994,"w":0.67835052490234382},{"w":0.72783503214518241,"h":0.013214539165575245,"c":1,"x":0.13402062815421298,"t":"Bumham has won. It means that next year they'Il be representing the region in the national","y":0.13358778647907255},{"c":1,"x":0.13195876159133074,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"championship.","y":0.1497093022473841,"w":0.11958763122558591},{"x":0.13195876505014942,"c":1,"w":0.76082473754882796,"t":"Now I've heard something about Paxton Nature Reserve. II's a good place for spotting unusual","h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.18604651167579889},{"w":0.1092783482869466,"t":"birds, isnt it?","h":0.013211978860833806,"c":1,"y":0.20199647682913358,"x":0.13195876391985509},{"h":0.017455635809996317,"y":0.2156031484525005,"w":0.73006103515624998,"t":"That's right - throughout the year. There is a lake there, as well as a river, and they provide","x":0.13187335190319591,"c":1},{"x":0.12989690817526214,"w":0.73814432779947925,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"y":0.23253082798730607,"t":"a very attractive habitat. So it's a good idea to bring binoculars if you have them. And just at"},{"t":"the moment you can see various flowers that are prefty unusual - the soil at Paxton isn't very","w":0.74859024047851563,"x":0.12982691760119772,"h":0.016867050197778344,"c":1,"y":0.24618045030738378},{"c":1,"x":0.13195876568648582,"t":"common. They re looking good right now.","w":0.32989690144856776,"y":0.26306517889401571,"h":0.013211978860833806},{"x":0.065979381946493998,"y":0.2805232559260622,"w":0.032989689509073883,"t":"SUE:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1},{"h":0.014534883616744931,"c":1,"w":0.44329895019531251,"t":"Right. My husband will be particularly interested in that.","x":0.13195877222193134,"y":0.2776162791184158},{"h":0.015648666578954695,"w":0.81658798217773432,"y":0.29259749848382188,"t":"MARTIN: And there's going to be a talk and slide show about mushrooms - and you'll be able to go out","c":1,"x":0.063869244551953933},{"t":"and pick some afterwards and study the different varieties","y":0.30813953493100077,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"x":0.12989691108294732,"w":0.46804122924804681},{"x":0.065979381938563772,"w":0.032989689509073883,"c":1,"t":"SUE:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"y":0.32558139545855003},{"t":"Uhuh. And is it possible for children to swim in the river?","h":0.015021491036720236,"x":0.13189061126403062,"y":0.32262652399196889,"w":0.4516755676269531,"c":1},{"x":0.063860706660875052,"h":0.016686767112207845,"c":1,"t":"MARTIN: Yes. Part of it has been fenced off to make il safe for children to swim in, It's very shallow, and","w":0.82072550455729165,"y":0.33680360095595097},{"x":0.13195876016708324,"t":"there's a lifeguard on duty whenever it's open. The lake is too deep, so swimming isn't allowed","y":0.35319767435159832,"w":0.75463918050130219,"h":0.013214539165575245,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.38517441837387723,"w":0.030927836100260411,"h":0.011627907341393073,"x":0.065979380807258112,"t":"SUE:"},{"w":0.77525772094726564,"x":0.12577320126338332,"y":0.38372093028236554,"t":"OK, we must remember to bring their swimming things, in case we go to Paxton. How long does","h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"t":"it take to get there by car from Bumham?","x":0.12983039343736436,"y":0.39820898938296945,"c":1,"w":0.33212519327799478,"h":0.013915704266855622},{"t":"MARTIN: About 20 minutes, but parking is very limited, so it's usually much easier to go by bus - and it","x":0.065979392746288376,"y":0.41279069754482534,"w":0.81237111409505203,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"w":0.2209063720703125,"h":0.013037058303304372,"x":0.13181348956165578,"y":0.42889665970182778,"c":1,"t":"takes about the same time."},{"c":1,"x":0.065979381869174389,"y":0.44622093042943156,"t":"SUE:","w":0.032989689509073897,"h":0.010174418083723991},{"t":"Right. Well, I'Il discuss the options with the rest of the family. Thanks very much for all your help","c":1,"x":0.13402061399309861,"y":0.44476744179351191,"w":0.76288660685221354,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"t":"MARTIN: You're Welcome.","h":0.013750345092343297,"y":0.45869850919299626,"c":1,"w":0.20236932118733725,"x":0.065841520665285314},{"c":1,"x":0.063917526283263748,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"y":0.4767441861606968,"t":"SUE:","w":0.032989689509073897},{"h":0.015166498252523697,"x":0.12773039179824366,"t":"Goodbye.","c":1,"y":0.47497489038282226,"w":0.086807257334391263},{"t":"MARTIN: Bye.","x":0.065782558979322447,"y":0.48898525652466329,"w":0.10564009348551431,"h":0.013820992031310153,"c":1},{"t":"SECTION 2","y":0.53924418608878344,"w":0.15670102437337238,"x":0.063917528947334434,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"w":0.035051546096801764,"c":1,"y":0.56831395360048087,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"x":0.063917525810214731,"t":"MAN:"},{"c":1,"t":"First of all, let me thank you all for coming to this public meeting, to discuss the future of our","y":0.56540697679398622,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.73608245849609366,"x":0.12989691498200936},{"y":0.58132706961337466,"t":"town. Our first speaker is Shona Ferguson, from Barford town council. Shona.","w":0.62886596679687501,"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.12783505773639167,"c":1},{"t":"sHoNA: Thank you. First I'll briefly give you some background information, then I'll be asking you for your","w":0.84123713175455717,"c":1,"x":0.063917516467067517,"h":0.01453488361674482,"y":0.59593023260450995},{"t":"comments on developments in the town.","c":1,"x":0.12773797184838165,"y":0.61066172201554358,"h":0.015840801993889153,"w":0.32805470784505208},{"x":0.12989691313370438,"y":0.62645348842195647,"t":"Wefl, as you don't need me to tell you, Barford has changed a great deal in the last 50 years.","w":0.74432988484700524,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"y":0.64157460733789851,"x":0.12979786166723944,"h":0.012717857965636292,"w":0.30743860880533852,"t":"These are some of the main changes.","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.70721649169921874,"t":"Fifty years ago, buses linked virtually every part of the town and the neighbouring towns","x":0.12783505300457837,"y":0.65697674423576413,"h":0.01453488361674482},{"t":"and villages. Most people used them frequently, but not now, because the bus companies.","w":0.72577316284179672,"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"x":0.12783507356191923,"y":0.67146212591805776},{"y":0.68749999993071809,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"x":0.12783505382391808,"w":0.76082473754882818,"t":"concentrate on just the routes that atract most passengers, So parts of the town are no longer"},{"t":"served by buses. Even replacing old uncomfortable buses with smart new ones has had little","y":0.70199647683943189,"w":0.74226801554361976,"c":1,"x":0.12989691987867236,"h":0.013211978860833917},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"x":0.12783504016343764,"y":0.7180232557469689,"t":"impact on passenger numbers. It's sometimes said that bus fares are too high, but in relation to","w":0.76494847615559902},{"c":1,"t":"average incomes, fares are not much higher than they were 50 years ago.","y":0.73253082798631675,"w":0.59793813069661461,"x":0.12577320258497413,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"Changes in the road network are affecting the town. The centre was recently closed to traffic on","w":0.76907216389973976,"c":1,"x":0.12577319629257383,"y":0.74709302330584204},{"x":0.12577321455494248,"w":0.74845357259114587,"y":0.7615971816093039,"t":"a trial basis, making it much safer for pedestrians. The impact of this is being measured. Ihe","c":1,"h":0.01614797416324143},{"w":0.75670104980468755,"t":"new cycle paths, separating bikes from cars in most main roads, are being used far more than","y":0.77906976737473221,"x":0.12783504201121693,"c":1,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"t":"was expected, reducing traffic and improving air quality. And although the council's attempts to","y":0.79359953048533571,"w":0.75876286824544281,"h":0.013211978860833806,"c":1,"x":0.12577320498140684},{"c":1,"y":0.80813953493054724,"x":0.12577320811127368,"w":0.77319585164388027,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"have a bypass constructed have failed, we haven't given up hope of persuading the govemment"},{"c":1,"w":0.15670102437337238,"x":0.12577319904469983,"h":0.013217953465227028,"y":0.82412790690254412,"t":"to change its mind."},{"x":0.12989691130652545,"h":0.013223927509623645,"t":"Shopping in the town centre has changed over the years. Many of us can remember when the","y":0.83852025860017176,"w":0.7525773111979166,"c":1},{"w":0.74639175415039061,"x":0.12783505064878606,"c":1,"y":0.85465116272363517,"h":0.013081395479068947,"t":"town was crowded with people going shopping. Numbers have been falling for several years,"},{"h":0.013212832295747656,"t":"despite efforts to attract shoppers, for instance by opening new car parks. Some people combine","w":0.77525772094726564,"y":0.86905460962803149,"x":0.12783505694649155,"c":1},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"y":0.94912790688348792,"w":0.039175256093343103,"t":"114","x":0.06391752673683361},{"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.29360280354817708,"x":0.35215498527080541,"y":0.95282647550815269,"h":0.0241457972187753},{"h":0.011627907341393184,"t":"Q6","x":0.91752577349464215,"w":0.026804122924804719,"c":1,"y":0.10319767418783055},{"w":0.028865979512532558,"y":0.18604651150333018,"x":0.91752577303661098,"h":0.013081395479069058,"c":1,"t":"Q7"},{"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"t":"Q8","y":0.23110465104316902,"w":0.028865979512532558,"x":0.91752577302723881},{"w":0.026804122924804719,"h":0.011627907341393184,"y":0.29215116255992357,"c":1,"t":"Q9","x":0.91752577349464215},{"y":0.34011627885324325,"h":0.011627907341393184,"x":0.91752577344721464,"w":0.041237112681070998,"c":1,"t":"Q10"},{"x":0.91752577276855996,"t":"Q11","y":0.67151162768831496,"w":0.037113402684529673,"c":1,"h":0.011627907341393184},{"c":1,"t":"Q12","w":0.039175256093343047,"x":0.91546391824198814,"h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.76308139524011664}],"w":2400,"h":3406}